          "topic": "Newton's second law and momentum",
          "content_type": "worked_example",
          "text": "A 2 kg cart changes velocity from 1 m/s to 4 m/s in 3 s. Its acceleration is (4 - 1)/3 = 1 m/s^2, so the net force is 2 × 1 = 2 N in the direction of motion.",
